OL,3,GNEWSAMixed views on city's 'patriotic'
OL,4,Aflag protocol
OL,5,
OL,6,FBradford has become the fourth Reform
OL,7,FUK-led council in West Yorkshire to
OL,8,Fadopt a more restrictive flag-flying
OL,9,Fpolicy.
OL,11,FOnly a limited number of flags,
OL,12,Fincluding the Union and St George's
OL,13,Fflags, as well as those of local sports
OL,14,Fteams, will be flown from flagpoles in
OL,15,FCentenary Square.
OL,17,FSupporters say the policy promotes
OL,18,Fpatriotism, unity and a shared civic
OL,19,Fidentity, while critics, both inside
OL,20,Fand outside the council chamber, fear
OL,21,Fit could undermine freedom of
OL,22,Fexpression and community cohesion.
OL,23,APub: 13-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,383,380,200,160,0,100
