OL,3,GNEWSAMixed views on city's 'patriotic'
OL,4,Aflag protocol
OL,5,
OL,6,FWhen we visited the city centre to
OL,7,Fgauge public opinion, two Union flags
OL,8,Fwere already flying above City Hall.
